# sememe program: the grammar (categories, combining rules, inflections).

/// A sentence or clause.
a0 atom S  @0 seed
/// A noun phrase: something that refers.
a1 atom NP  @0 seed
/// A noun: a description that still needs a determiner to refer.
a2 atom N  @0 seed

/// Forward application: X/Y Y => X.
g0 rule fapp  @0 seed
/// Backward application: Y X\Y => X.
g1 rule bapp  @0 seed

